<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/87"/>And their meal offerings and libations
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/88"/>as prescribed:
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/89"/>three tenths [of an <tei:hi rend="italic">ephah</tei:hi> of fine flour]
