<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/91"/>two tenths for each ram,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/92"/>and one tenth for each lamb,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/93"/>and wine according to each libation,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/94"/>and a he-goat for atonement,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/95"/>and the two daily burnt offerings
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/96"/>according to their law.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/29/23"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/97"/>And on the fourth day [you will offer]
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/98"/>ten bullocks
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/99"/>two rams
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/100"/>fourteen male yearling lambs
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/101"/>without blemish
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/102"/>And their meal offerings and libations
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/103"/>as prescribed:
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/104"/>three tenths [of an <tei:hi rend="italic">ephah</tei:hi> of fine flour]
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/105"/>for each bullock,
