<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/109"/>and a he-goat for atonement,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/110"/>and the two daily burnt offerings
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/111"/>according to their law.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en">Continue אֱלֹהֵינוּ וֵאלֹהֵי אֲבוֹתֵינוּ Our God and God of our fathers.</tei:note>
<tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en">On the third day of Chol HaMoed Sukkos:</tei:note>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/112"/>And on the fourth day [you will offer]
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehi_ratzon_milefanekha_adonai_eloheinu/113"/>ten bullocks
